abstract: >-
  Expository note and Lean 4 axiomatic specification recording the classical
  theorem of Zucker (1977) and Beauville–Donagi (1985) that the rational Hodge
  conjecture holds for every smooth cubic fourfold X in P^5 via the incidence
  correspondence of the Fano variety of lines F(X). Explicitly scoped as a
  classical literature boundary ledger (zero sorry) and not a claim on the
  general fourfold Hodge conjecture. Author: Benjamin Stanley Frohman.
